  "question": {
    "text": "The line through the points&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has slope <math><mi>m</mi></math>. Then, the&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi></math>-intercept of this line is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>18</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, the equation of line is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-intercept of the line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></p>"
  }
